From b060eb65a519aebcb1b783e4b7b6c8002b045e8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pm-official-id <pm-official-id@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:53:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Backup & restore: settings, playlists, logins; not downloads
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Settings → Data → Backup. One .lokalbak zip holds the app preferences
(settings and playlists), the Mornye tree with its master key (add-on
logins, credentials and sessions), and a consistent snapshot of the Isar
library database. Downloaded music is never part of a backup.

Restore replaces all of the above and closes the app; opening it again
continues from the backup. Prefs round-trip with their types; a vault-less
backup restores on fresh installs; garbage and future-format files are
refused. Round-trip tests in test/services/backup_service_test.dart.
